# Cline Project Rules

## Memory Bank

- Read relevant files from `.ai-docs/` as project context before making significant changes.
- Treat the information in `.ai-docs/` as authoritative project context.
- Do not modify files inside `.ai-docs/`.
- Do not invent missing project information. Ask the user when required information is unavailable.
- If a development change appears to affect durable project knowledge, architecture, requirements, or an important milestone, inform the user and identify the potentially affected `.ai-docs/` file.
- The user and ChatGPT are responsible for maintaining and updating the Memory Bank.